title Home Assistant: the tile's action: Enter on the Reading lamp ("..." until Home Assistant answers, then On, amber, the glyph lit); on the deck a tap on its icon turns it off again, a tap right of the slider's knob steps the brightness up by 10 %, the scene's icon runs it (Done)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key down
key right
key enter
wait 120
shot pending
expect text "..."
wait 900
expect text "On"
shot toggled-on
check toggled-on
@640x480 tapxy 0.567 0.379
@640x480 wait 900
@640x480 expect text "Off"
@640x480 shot tapped-off
@640x480 tapxy 0.80 0.5625
@640x480 wait 1200
@640x480 expect text "82 %"
@640x480 shot slider-tapped
@640x480 drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.40
@640x480 wait 400
@640x480 shot scrolled-for-scene
expect noquit
